data sources  : the single web hook bound through the shared KMP core. The view performs NO HTTP (ADR-002/ADR-004).
  - useChargingSessionsPaginated  GET /charging?vehicle_id=&limit=2000&offset=0[&start][&end]
        -> ChargingRepository.sessionsPaginated(vehicleId, 2000, 0, start, end) : Flow<Resource<List<ChargingSession>>>
  web hook name kept verbatim at the Kotlin seam: ChargingHeatmapPageSource.chargingSessionsPaginated
  (ChargingHeatmapPageSource.kt L41-45). The Android DataContainer wires no shared ChargingStore (S8), so the
  host binds the shared-core S7 HttpChargingRepository (the same KMP port of the web useCharging hook domain)
  built from the DataContainer's resilient ApiHttpClient + offline CacheStore, exactly as the sibling
  BatteryHealthPage does; the view-model projects it onto the lifecycle-aware UiState (the S8-equivalent render
  projection). The typed SI ChargingSession DTO (started_at, ended_at, total_energy_added_wh, cost_decimal,
  start_place) is read directly. (Honesty Covenant #9 — documented, not silent.)

files created :
  ChargingHeatmapPageModel.kt      framework-free: Registration, HeatCell/HeatGrid/HeatStats/LocationCount,
                                   dayAndHour/buildGrid (web buildGrid), computeStats (web stats), durationMinutes,
                                   topLocations (web locationData), heatLevel (web heatColor tiers), dayName/hourLabel,
                                   recordChargingHeatmapOpened, ChargingHeatmapDisplayPrefs (Wh->kWh + s->min + locale
                                   number fmt). JVM-unit-testable (java.time + shared units only).
  ChargingHeatmapPageIcons.kt      ChargingHeatmapGlyphs.Activity (web lucide Activity empty-state icon), authored
                                   locally as a 24x24 stroked vector (BatteryHealthPageIcons precedent).
  ChargingHeatmapPageSource.kt     seam + chargingHeatmapPageSourceOf(charging, settingsStore, selectedVehicleStore).
  ChargingHeatmapPageViewModel.kt  BaseFeedViewModel: sessions StateFlow<UiState<List<ChargingSession>>> scoped to the
                                   global active vehicle (web useSelectedVehicle) + refresh trigger, displayPrefs
                                   StateFlow (web useUnits), refresh/retry/recordViewOpened.
  ChargingHeatmapPage.kt           stateless Compose render layer: chrome + sessions-gated body (loader/error/loaded);
                                   4 summary cards + favorite panel + 7x24 heatmap grid (tap-to-inspect + legend) +
                                   top-locations bar chart.
  ChargingHeatmapPageHost.kt       PageHosts.register("chargingHeatmap") for the /charging-heatmap destination.

