panel map    : the 7 manifest GlassPanels = web's 4 stat <GlassPanel> tiles (Total Sessions/Energy/Cost/Avg
               Duration, L163-185) + the favorite <GlassPanel> (L191) + the heatmap <GlassPanel> (L203) + the
               top-locations <GlassPanel> (L257). All 7 always render -> no hidden panels (ADR-011 #6): the web
               hides the favorite panel when maxCount==0, the native port keeps it visible with a common.noData
               note; the heatmap grid always draws its 7x24 cells (all-cold when empty, web parity).
chart        : single BarChart = the A3 BarChartWrapper (Vico cartesian column chart, native Compose, no webview)
               over the >=2-session top-ten locations; web ResponsiveContainer>BarChart layout="vertical".
               Orientation differs (Vico native columns vs web horizontal bars) — the A3 wrapper, not pixel cloning.
states       : the single useChargingSessionsPaginated feed drives loading/empty/error/success via UiState; no
               selection or an empty list resolves to Empty so the page draws every panel in its empty form.
units (SI)   : total_energy_added_wh(Wh)->kWh via prefs.energy/formatEnergy; per-session duration(s)->min via
               prefs.duration/formatDuration; cost rendered verbatim through the shared Currency surface. Day-of-week
               + hour read in the device time zone (web new Date().getDay()/getHours()). SI never stored converted
               (Phase-48 SI-canonical / unit-conversion.instructions).
i18n         : every visible literal via stringResource (ADR-014); web key names kept. The 11 charging.heatmap.* keys
               + common.noData already in the generated res/values catalog (all locales). 5 native-port helper keys
               ADDED to res/values/strings.xml for the composed favorite line / heatmap cell detail / chart series /
               grid a11y (web composes these inline in English): translation_charging_heatmap_favorite_value,
               _sessions_count, _cell, _sessions_axis, _grid_aria. lint MissingTranslation/ExtraTranslation disabled.
a11y         : Compose semantics content descriptions on every heat cell (day/hour/sessions/kWh), the bar chart
               (grid_aria), and tap-to-inspect detail; >=48dp Material 3 targets; dynamic-color + dark theme via
               MaterialTheme tokens (heat tiers map to TeslaTokens.status.* with computed alpha); no hardcoded colors.
range        : the web optional date RangePicker resolves to its default 'all' preset (undefined start/end -> whole
               history); that picker is a separate shared surface outside this page's allowed-files scope, so the
               feed reads the same all-time window the web default requests (Honesty Covenant #9 — documented).
nav          : Destinations 'chargingHeatmap' -> /charging-heatmap pre-existing (Destinations.kt L59, count unchanged);
               host wired via PageHosts.register("chargingHeatmap") in TeslaSyncApplication.onCreate; deep link
               auto-registered by the NavHost. DataContainer untouched (ApiHttpClient/CacheStore/SettingsStore/
               SelectedVehicleStore already exposed).
